%% Bibliography for the general introduction and the general conclusion only.
%% Each chapter keeps the .bib file that came with its Overleaf project; the
%% import script wires those up for you in tex/_generated_preamble.tex.
%%
%% Two things break .bib files in this template:
%%
%%  1. Drop the abstract, keywords, doi, url and isbn fields. Biber copies them
%%     into the .bbl verbatim, and a single unescaped % or & inside an abstract
%%     breaks the whole bibliography. tools/clean_bib.py does this for you.
%%
%%  2. The APA style lower-cases titles, so protect proper nouns with braces:
%%     title = {Evidence from {Colombia}}
